# Command c3x

## What does this command do:

Open source cloud cost estimation for Terraform, Terragrunt, and CloudFormation

## Installed from

For Fedora install using: curl -sSfL https://github.com/c3xdev/c3x/releases/download/v1.0.1/c3x-linux-amd64.tar.gz -o /tmp/c3x.tar.gz && tar -xzf /tmp/c3x.tar.gz -C /tmp && mv /tmp/c3x-linux-amd64 ~/.local/bin/c3x && chmod +x ~/.local/bin/c3x
For Raspberry Pi install using: curl -sSfL https://github.com/c3xdev/c3x/releases/download/v1.0.1/c3x-linux-arm64.tar.gz -o /tmp/c3x.tar.gz && tar -xzf /tmp/c3x.tar.gz -C /tmp && mv /tmp/c3x-linux-arm64 ~/.local/bin/c3x && chmod +x ~/.local/bin/c3x
For Mac install using: brew install c3xdev/tap/c3x

## Command path

For Fedora run: ~/.local/bin/c3x
For Raspberry Pi run: ~/.local/bin/c3x
For Mac run: /opt/homebrew/bin/c3x

## Command documentation

Docs can be found at https://github.com/c3xdev/c3x

## Command options

### Subcommands

  estimate    Estimate cloud infrastructure costs from Terraform/Terragrunt/CloudFormation
  diff        Show monthly cost diff between current and a saved baseline
  recommend   Suggest cost optimizations (newer instance types, cheaper storage, etc.)
  pricing     Manage local pricing data for offline estimation
  config      Display or change global configuration
  report      Combine and format C3X JSON output files
  comment     Post a C3X cost comment to GitHub, GitLab, Azure Repos, or Bitbucket
  upload      Upload a C3X JSON file to C3X Cloud
  auth        Get or manage a C3X API key
  generate    Generate C3X configuration files
  completion  Generate shell completion script

### estimate flags

  -p, --path string                  Path to Terraform directory or plan JSON file
      --terraform-var-file strings   Load .tfvars file(s) (relative to --path)
      --terraform-var stringArray    Set input variable (-var style)
      --terraform-workspace string   Terraform workspace to use
      --usage-file string            Path to usage file for usage-based resources
      --what-if stringArray          Override resource attributes (e.g. 'aws_instance.web.instance_type=m6i.xlarge')
      --budget float                 Fail (exit 1) if monthly cost exceeds this amount
      --format string                Output format: table, json, html (default: table)
      --out-file string              Save output to file
      --offline                      Use local pricing DB (run 'c3x pricing sync' first)
      --recommend                    Show optimization recommendations inline
      --show-skipped                 List unsupported resources
      --no-cache                     Skip Terraform plan caching
      --fields strings               Output fields: all, price, monthlyQuantity, unit, hourlyCost, monthlyCost

### diff flags

  -p, --path string          Path to Terraform directory or plan JSON file
      --compare-to string    Path to C3X baseline JSON file
      --budget-increase float  Fail (exit 1) if cost increase exceeds this percentage
      --format string        Output format: diff, json (default: diff)
      --out-file string      Save output to file

### recommend flags

  -p, --path string    Path to Terraform directory or plan JSON file
      --format string  Output format: table, json (default: table)

### pricing subcommands

  sync    Download pricing data from cloud providers (--providers aws,azure,google)
  status  Show local pricing database status

### Global flags

      --no-color           Disable colored output
      --log-level string   Log level: trace, debug, info, warn, error, fatal
      --debug-report       Generate a debug report file for the C3X team

### Common workflows

  # Estimate costs for current Terraform directory
  c3x estimate --path .

  # Estimate with a tfvars file
  c3x estimate --path . --terraform-var-file prod.tfvars

  # Save baseline, make changes, then diff
  c3x estimate --path . --format json --out-file baseline.json
  c3x diff --path . --compare-to baseline.json

  # What-if scenario without changing code
  c3x estimate --path . --what-if 'aws_instance.web.instance_type=m6i.2xlarge'

  # Enforce a $500/month budget (exits 1 if exceeded)
  c3x estimate --path . --budget 500

  # Get optimization recommendations
  c3x recommend --path .

  # Offline mode (download pricing data first)
  c3x pricing sync --providers aws
  c3x estimate --path . --offline
